From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: mediatek: mt6797: add the GPIO66 Schmitt trigger
 field

The Gemini lid on GPIO66 follows the magnet in the GPIO data register but
never raises EINT5. When a real pad becomes an EINT, the common code
enables its Schmitt trigger and ignores -ENOTSUPP, assuming every real
GPIO has one. MT6797 maps no SMT field, so the lid pad stays without
Schmitt conditioning, and no real-pad EINT has worked on mainline MT6797.

Map GPIO66's SMT bit, IOCFG_R 0x30 bit 27, from the vendor GPIO table.
The bit also serves GPIO67, the microSD card-detect input. Other pins
keep unsupported SMT.

Unsigned experiment draft; archive identity is non-certifying.
---
 drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6797.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6797.c b/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6797.c
index 2e7442865..5e0019301 100644
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6797.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/mediatek/pinctrl-mt6797.c
@@ -41,6 +41,11 @@ static const struct mtk_pin_field_calc mt6797_pin_ies_range[] = {
 	PIN_FIELD_CALC(66, 66, 3, 0x10, 0x10, 13, 1, 32, 0),
 };
 
+/* IOCFG_R SMT bit 27 serves GPIO66 and GPIO67 together. */
+static const struct mtk_pin_field_calc mt6797_pin_smt_range[] = {
+	PIN_FIELD_CALC(66, 66, 3, 0x30, 0x10, 27, 1, 32, 0),
+};
+
 static const struct mtk_pin_field_calc mt6797_pin_pu_range[] = {
 	PIN_FIELD_CALC(66, 66, 3, 0xe0, 0x10, 13, 1, 32, 0),
 };
@@ -55,6 +60,7 @@ static const struct mtk_pin_reg_calc mt6797_reg_cals[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_MAX] = {
 	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_DI] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_di_range),
 	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_DO] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_do_range),
 	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_IES] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_ies_range),
+	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_SMT] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_smt_range),
 	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_PU] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_pu_range),
 	[PINCTRL_PIN_REG_PD] = MTK_RANGE(mt6797_pin_pd_range),
 };
